sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Student
    participant UI as Client (React UI)
    participant API as API Router (Express)
    participant SIM as Simulation Engine
    participant MATH as Deterministic Math Engines
    participant DB as MySQL DB (Prisma)

    User->>UI: Enter Scenario: Purchase ₹45,000 (Laptop)
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/engine/simulate (Scenario Payload)
    Note over API: Zod Validation & JWT Auth
    API->>SIM: runSimulation(userId, scenario)
    
    SIM->>DB: Fetch Baseline Snapshot (Cash, Budgets, Obligations)
    DB-->>SIM: Return Committed Database State
    
    rect rgb(240, 245, 255)
        Note over SIM: In-Memory Deep Clone<br/>Zero Database Mutation
        SIM->>SIM: stateClone = structuredClone(baseline)
        SIM->>SIM: Inject Perturbation (Cash - ₹45,000)
        SIM->>MATH: evaluateStateAndRisk(stateClone)
        MATH-->>SIM: Return Simulated (Health', Risk', Runway')
        SIM->>SIM: Compute Delta Matrix (ΔHealth, ΔRisk, ΔRunway)
    end

    SIM-->>API: Return { baseline, simulated, deltaMatrix }
    API-->>UI: HTTP 200 OK (Simulation Response)
    UI->>UI: Render Before vs After Cards & Delta Matrix
    UI-->>User: Displays Financial Impact (Runway -28 Days, Risk +22)
